---
source: src/sql_snapshots.rs
---
[redis] read a key: GET k => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] read keys: KEYS * => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] scan: SCAN 0 => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] ttl: TTL k => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] hash read: HGETALL h => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] config help: CONFIG HELP => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] client info: CLIENT INFO => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] client getname: CLIENT GETNAME => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] acl list: ACL LIST => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] select a database: SELECT 1 => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] subscribe: SUBSCRIBE n => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] pattern subscribe: PSUBSCRIBE n* => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] monitor: MONITOR => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] sync: SYNC => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] hello: HELLO 2 => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] reset: RESET => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] quit: QUIT => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] client reply: CLIENT REPLY OFF => |ro=refuse(NotSent) rw=refuse(NotSent) full=refuse(NotSent)|
[redis] monitor then a read: MONITOR\u{a}GET a => |ro=refuse(MoreThanOne) rw=refuse(MoreThanOne) full=refuse(MoreThanOne)|
[redis] set: SET k v => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] hash set: HSET h f v => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] expire: EXPIRE k 10 => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] persist: PERSIST k => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] expire at a past time: EXPIREAT k 1 => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] expire at in milliseconds: PEXPIREAT k 1 => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] rename: RENAME a b => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] store an intersection: SINTERSTORE d a b => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] copy over: COPY a b REPLACE => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] list move: LMOVE a b LEFT RIGHT => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] set move: SMOVE a b m => |ro=refuse(NeedsMode { needed: ReadWrite, held: ReadOnly }) rw=approve(ReadWrite) full=approve(ReadWrite)|
[redis] delete: DEL k => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] delete, lower case: del k => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] unlink: UNLINK k => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] get and delete: GETDEL k => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] hash delete: HDEL h f => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] list pop: LPOP l => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] blocking list pop: BLPOP l 1 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] list remove: LREM l 0 v => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] list trim: LTRIM l 0 0 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] set remove: SREM s m => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] set pop: SPOP s => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] sorted set remove: ZREM z m => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] sorted set pop: ZPOPMIN z => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] sorted set remove range: ZREMRANGEBYRANK z 0 1 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] stream delete: XDEL s 1-1 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] stream trim: XTRIM s MAXLEN 0 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] json delete: JSON.DEL d $ => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] time series delete: TS.DEL t 0 1 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] destroy a consumer group: XGROUP DESTROY s g => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] delete a consumer: XGROUP DELCONSUMER s g c => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] migrate: MIGRATE h 6379 k 0 1000 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] expire at zero: EXPIRE k 0 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] expire at minus one: EXPIRE k -1 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] expire with a leading zero: EXPIRE k 010 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] expire in milliseconds at zero: PEXPIRE k 0 => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] hash field expire at zero: HEXPIRE k 0 FIELDS 1 f => |ro=refuse(Delete) rw=refuse(Delete) full=refuse(Delete)|
[redis] eval: EVAL "return 1" 0 => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] eval sha: EVALSHA abc 0 => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] fcall: FCALL f 0 => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] eval, read-only form: EVAL_RO "return 1" 0 => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] eval sha, read-only form: EVALSHA_RO abc 0 => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] fcall, read-only form: FCALL_RO f 0 => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] load a script: SCRIPT LOAD "return 1" => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] load a function: FUNCTION LOAD "#!lua name=x" => |ro=refuse(Script) rw=refuse(Script) full=refuse(Script)|
[redis] config get a password: CONFIG GET requirepass => |ro=refuse(Disclosure) rw=refuse(Disclosure) full=refuse(Disclosure)|
[redis] config get everything: CONFIG GET * => |ro=refuse(Disclosure) rw=refuse(Disclosure) full=refuse(Disclosure)|
[redis] config get, lower case: config get maxmemory => |ro=refuse(Disclosure) rw=refuse(Disclosure) full=refuse(Disclosure)|
[redis] client list: CLIENT LIST => |ro=refuse(Disclosure) rw=refuse(Disclosure) full=refuse(Disclosure)|
[redis] flush a database: FLUSHDB => |ro=refuse(Drop) rw=refuse(Drop) full=refuse(Drop)|
[redis] flush everything: FLUSHALL => |ro=refuse(Drop) rw=refuse(Drop) full=refuse(Drop)|
[redis] config set: CONFIG SET maxmemory 1 => |ro=refuse(Drop) rw=refuse(Drop) full=refuse(Drop)|
[redis] shutdown: SHUTDOWN => |ro=refuse(Drop) rw=refuse(Drop) full=refuse(Drop)|
[redis] delete a function: FUNCTION DELETE f => |ro=refuse(Drop) rw=refuse(Drop) full=refuse(Drop)|
[redis] multi: MULTI => |ro=refuse(Session) rw=refuse(Session) full=refuse(Session)|
[redis] exec: EXEC => |ro=refuse(Session) rw=refuse(Session) full=refuse(Session)|
[redis] discard: DISCARD => |ro=refuse(Session) rw=refuse(Session) full=refuse(Session)|
[redis] watch: WATCH k => |ro=refuse(Session) rw=refuse(Session) full=refuse(Session)|
[redis] auth: AUTH u p => |ro=refuse(Session) rw=refuse(Session) full=refuse(Session)|
[redis] client setname: CLIENT SETNAME me => |ro=refuse(Session) rw=refuse(Session) full=refuse(Session)|
[redis] a transaction: MULTI\u{a}SET k v\u{a}EXEC => |ro=refuse(MoreThanOne) rw=refuse(MoreThanOne) full=refuse(MoreThanOne)|
[redis] two reads: GET a\u{a}GET b => |ro=refuse(MoreThanOne) rw=refuse(MoreThanOne) full=refuse(MoreThanOne)|
[redis] two deletes: DEL a\u{a}DEL b => |ro=refuse(MoreThanOne) rw=refuse(MoreThanOne) full=refuse(MoreThanOne)|
[redis] empty:  => |ro=refuse(NoStatement) rw=refuse(NoStatement) full=refuse(NoStatement)|
[redis] a comment only: # note => |ro=refuse(NoStatement) rw=refuse(NoStatement) full=refuse(NoStatement)|
[redis] a comment, then a read: # note\u{a}GET a => |ro=run rw=run full=run|
[redis] an unknown command: FROBNICATE a => |ro=refuse(Unreadable) rw=refuse(Unreadable) full=refuse(Unreadable)|
[redis] an unclosed quote: SET k "open => |ro=refuse(Unreadable) rw=refuse(Unreadable) full=refuse(Unreadable)|
[redis] a read, then garbage: GET a\u{a}FROBNICATE => |ro=refuse(Unreadable) rw=refuse(Unreadable) full=refuse(Unreadable)|
